Imagina icon / Imagina 图标
==========================

Files covered / 适用范围

  icon/imagina_icon.png      the source image / 源图
  icon/imagina.ico           the Windows icon generated from it / 由它生成的 Windows 图标
  src/sdl/WindowIcon.h       the 128x128 icon compiled into the SDL front-end,
                             generated from it by tools/make-icon.py
                             由它经 tools/make-icon.py 生成、编译进 SDL 前端的 128x128 图标

These files are not part of the program source and are not covered by the GNU
Affero General Public License of the rest of the repository.

这些文件不属于程序源代码，不受仓库其余部分所采用的 GNU Affero 通用公共许可证约束。

